### lys-shell Configuration - Minimized Windows Module

## Minimized Windows Module Configuration

settings-modules-minimized-windows-icon = Icon
    .description = Icon for a window whose app has no desktop entry icon, and the module's icon while nothing is minimized

settings-modules-minimized-windows-icon-size = Icon Size
    .description = Size of each window's icon

settings-modules-minimized-windows-show-when-empty = Show When Empty
    .description = Keep the module on the bar while nothing is minimized

settings-modules-minimized-windows-scope = Outputs
    .description = Which outputs' minimized windows the module lists

## WindowScope variants
enum-window-scope-output = This Output
enum-window-scope-all = All Outputs
